---

<section id="oferta" class="py-24 md:py-32">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="mb-14">
      <div class="section-label">
        <span data-lang="pl">Oferta współpracy</span>
        <span data-lang="en">Collaboration offer</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-ink mb-4 leading-tight">
        <span data-lang="pl">Jak możemy pracować razem</span>
        <span data-lang="en">How we can work together</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-ink-muted text-lg max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
        <span data-lang="pl">Współpraca może być jednorazowa, projektowa lub długoterminowa.
        Mogę wejść jako external expert — nie muszę zastępować całego zespołu,
        żeby pomóc mu działać lepiej.</span>
        <span data-lang="en">Collaboration can be one-time, project-based, or long-term.
        I can come in as an external expert — I don't need to replace the entire team
        to help it perform better.</span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
      {offers.map(offer => (
        <div class="card flex flex-col gap-4">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-bg-elevated flex items-center justify-center text-accent flex-shrink-0">
              <Fragment set:html={offer.icon} />
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-ink-subtle border border-border px-2 py-1 rounded-full whitespace-nowrap">
              <span data-lang="pl">{offer.type.pl}</span>
              <span data-lang="en">{offer.type.en}</span>
            </span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-ink font-semibold text-base mb-2 leading-snug">
              <span data-lang="pl">{offer.title.pl}</span>
              <span data-lang="en">{offer.title.en}</span>
            </h3>
            <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              <span data-lang="pl">{offer.desc.pl}</span>
              <span data-lang="en">{offer.desc.en}</span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 p-8 border border-border bg-bg-card rounded-2xl flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-ink font-semibold text-lg mb-1">
          <span data-lang="pl">Nie wiesz, od czego zacząć?</span>
          <span data-lang="en">Don't know where to start?</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm">
          <span data-lang="pl">Napisz krótko, co chcesz osiągnąć lub jaki problem chcesz rozwiązać. Razem ustalimy, co ma sens.</span>
          <span data-lang="en">Write briefly what you want to achieve or what problem you want to solve. We'll figure out what makes sense together.</span>
        </p>
      </div>
      <a
        href="#kontakt"
        class="flex-shrink-0 inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-accent hover:bg-accent-dark text-white font-medium px-6 py-3 rounded-lg transition-colors text-sm"
      >
        <span data-lang="pl">Porozmawiajmy</span>
        <span data-lang="en">Let's talk</span>
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round">
          <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
